{"product_id":"math-a-day","title":"Math-A-Day","description":"\u003cp\u003e366 days of mathematical problems and puzzles and Thought of the Day from luminaries of science. This book is different: It will never get out of date You can use it day after day, year after year: 24x7 Math-a-Day is a book to make mathematics part of our lives. This is not a calendar nor a reference book but a compendium of mathematical information that will give you your math fix every day of the year. Keep abreast with your mathematical aptitude and more... Each day has a THOUGHT by luminaries in the field of mathematics to brighten your day. Believe It or Not in Mathematics is full of surprises. Math-a-Day needs attention day in and out. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:132 x 193  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Sunil Chugh \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9788129118271 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 160\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44886328410265,"sku":"17RB-59788129118271","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/9aab83e1ffe896f256f351d2db0e0580.jpg?v=1728496614","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/math-a-day","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}